@startuml
' Genesis Protocol — Player action + narrative stream
actor Player
participant Composer
participant ClientStore
participant API
participant RuntimeSteward
participant RulesLawyer
participant AtomicEngine
participant EventLedger
participant NarrativeService
participant ProjectionBuilder
participant ActiveEngagement
Player -> Composer : Submit declaration
Composer -> API : POST intent {campaign_id, epoch, revision, text}
API -> RuntimeSteward : interpret intent
RuntimeSteward -> RulesLawyer : validate mechanics
RulesLawyer --> RuntimeSteward : legal / illegal / ruling required
RuntimeSteward -> AtomicEngine : approved mutation
AtomicEngine -> EventLedger : append canonical event
EventLedger -> NarrativeService : provide resolved facts
NarrativeService --> API : streamed cinematic output
API --> ActiveEngagement : stream chunks tagged campaign_id + epoch + revision
ActiveEngagement -> ClientStore : accept matching chunks only
EventLedger -> ProjectionBuilder : rebuild affected projection
ProjectionBuilder --> ClientStore : RFC6902 patch / updated projection
ClientStore -> ActiveEngagement : render committed state
@enduml
